sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / CI
    participant CLI as llmdbenchmark CLI
    participant Config as Config Engine<br/>Jinja2 + YAML
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Helm as Helm / Helmfile
    participant Harness as Harness Pod<br/>StatefulSet
    participant Endpoint as Inference Endpoint<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant PVC as PVC<br/>Filesystem
    participant Cloud as GCS / S3<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+

    Note over User, Cloud: Flow 1: Benchmark Lifecycle (standup → run → teardown)

    User->>CLI: llmdbenchmark standup --spec gpu-a100 --models model-name
    CLI->>Config: Load defaults.yaml + scenario + spec + CLI overrides
    Config-->>CLI: Rendered Kubernetes manifests
    CLI->>HF: Validate model access<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN Bearer
    HF-->>CLI: Model metadata / access confirmed
    CLI->>K8s: Apply manifests (kubectl)<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
    K8s-->>CLI: Resources created

    alt Modelservice deployment
        CLI->>Helm: helmfile apply (modelservice chart)
        Helm->>K8s: Install Helm release<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
        K8s-->>Helm: Resources created
    end

    User->>CLI: llmdbenchmark run --harness inference-perf
    CLI->>K8s: Deploy harness pod (StatefulSet)<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
    K8s-->>CLI: Pod running
    Harness->>Endpoint: Load generation requests<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP
    Endpoint-->>Harness: Inference responses
    Harness->>PVC: Write benchmark results

    User->>CLI: llmdbenchmark collect
    CLI->>K8s: kubectl exec (retrieve results)<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
    K8s-->>CLI: Result artifacts
    CLI->>Cloud: Upload results<br/>Auth: google-auth / AWS IAM
    Cloud-->>CLI: Upload confirmed

    User->>CLI: llmdbenchmark teardown
    CLI->>K8s: Delete resources<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
    K8s-->>CLI: Resources deleted

    Note over User, Cloud: Flow 2: Stack Discovery

    participant Disc as llm_d_stack_discovery
    participant GW as Gateway / Route /<br/>InferencePool

    User->>Disc: llm-d-stack-discovery --url endpoint-url
    Disc->>K8s: Query Gateway resources<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
    K8s-->>Disc: Gateway / HTTPRoute objects
    Disc->>K8s: Query InferencePool / InferenceModel<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
    K8s-->>Disc: Pool topology
    Disc-->>User: Stack topology (JSON/YAML/summary)
